{"name": "Greeded", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE PHYSICS IS A TOOL</h2>A robot with multiple manipulator arms finds himself in a ruined space station. The way to salvation lies through utilizing physics to creatively manipulate objects, solving challenging puzzles and self-aware exploration.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"220\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598950/extras/06df974a8c9bbe5b1fac72e4cc6e55d7.poster.avif?t=1782224239\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598950/extras/06df974a8c9bbe5b1fac72e4cc6e55d7.webm?t=1782224239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598950/extras/06df974a8c9bbe5b1fac72e4cc6e55d7.mp4?t=1782224239\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FIND A WAY OUT</h2>Investigate the mysterious and dangerous world of distant space on the edge of human scientific knowledge. Immerse yourself in the incredible spaces of a devastated station.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"220\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598950/extras/1b4d9fa8a59fecbb87061b7e75223452.poster.avif?t=1782224239\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598950/extras/1b4d9fa8a59fecbb87061b7e75223452.webm?t=1782224239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598950/extras/1b4d9fa8a59fecbb87061b7e75223452.mp4?t=1782224239\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FIGURE OUT THE SYSTEMS</h2>Upgrade your robotic limbs and strengthen your body to more effectively overcome obstacles, open previously inaccessible areas and defeat various enemies.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"220\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598950/extras/f6b7e56726a3b96cad3ced8d6edc6634.poster.avif?t=1782224239\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598950/extras/f6b7e56726a3b96cad3ced8d6edc6634.webm?t=1782224239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598950/extras/f6b7e56726a3b96cad3ced8d6edc6634.mp4?t=1782224239\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE TRUTH BEHIND EXPERIMENTS</h2>Dive deeper into the plot to uncover the secrets behind enigmatic researches. The storyline of the game is shaped by the choices you make as you progress.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"220\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598950/extras/99c25ad71469bf51836c2fb7c5e51edd.poster.avif?t=1782224239\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598950/extras/99c25ad71469bf51836c2fb7c5e51edd.webm?t=1782224239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598950/extras/99c25ad71469bf51836c2fb7c5e51edd.mp4?t=1782224239\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><br/> </div>", "short_desc": "Greeded is a stylish physics puzzle game about a long-armed robot in outer space. Change tools, mine resources and explore an abandoned space station.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598950/header.jpg?t=1782224239", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Singleplayer